{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_2000_place", "source_sha256": "a098538aba25f296516af694f5127b1d7d6282a743ca53b1e2073a5775c50fda", "ja": "撮影スタジオ入り口", "zh": "摄影棚入口", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f435f4156211805f204a0be8ff68c3a664a54536a1a3ffefeb684af9648f3315", "ja": "も～、{$P$}さんてば、遅～い！\nわたし、とっくに着いて待ってたんですからね～？", "zh": "讨厌～{$P$}先生好慢～！\n我可是早早就到这里等你了耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_2002_p", "source_sha256": "b043f23840c849f82e2486d317e21ce4b2804bb3e00f471528af797864f1e169", "ja": "ああ、ごめん……って、まだ集合時間前じゃないか。\n翼、時間を間違えたのか？", "zh": "啊啊，抱歉……等等，不是还没到集合时间吗？\n翼，你搞错时间了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_2003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e2506edf9a81095ae5e56c15f0bd47df4c5c2e865149dcd53aa6a7162654b860", "ja": "もう、違いますよ～。……今日のPV撮影って、\nいま超人気の、あのグループなんですよね？", "zh": "讨厌，才不是啦～今天拍摄的PV，\n是那个现在超红的团体对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_2004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4d21fdabeda05ff90d35843c051d080d926c92aa14f82f399631ed1b1f6f644b", "ja": "学校にも、ファンの子、多いんですよ～。\nあ～、もうドキドキする～。どうしよ～！？", "zh": "他们在学校也有很多粉丝喔～\n啊～我心脏已经跳得好快了～怎么办～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_2005_p", "source_sha256": "49940f4662a8b3416fdd91b4662b0114e72333991f154b0340048dc7a62122e9", "ja": "なら、万全の状態で臨まなきゃな。良い仕事をしたら、\n翼のことを覚えてくれるかもしれないし……。", "zh": "那么，得以万全状态上场才行了。工作如果\n表现得好，对方说不定也会记住翼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_2006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e35b58dc4ab5662f1118a857fb7dc877343f9b6e9a2257fc93179026b2730240", "ja": "えーっ、ホントですか！？　よ～し、集中集中……。\nテンション上げて、行ってきま～す♪", "zh": "咦～真的吗！？好～集中集中……\n我要提起干劲上场啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
